o preserve and protect this historic building.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>How can the community get involved in preserving the Courthouse? </strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Residents of Colbert County can get involved in preserving the Courthouse by participating in community events and activities, supporting restoration and preservation efforts, and volunteering their time and resources.</p>\n",
